{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096831876.331, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096831876.3298, "mode": "speaking"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096835247.478, "type": "utterance", "t_start": 1791096831876.38, "t_end": 1791096835247.4539, "role": "agent", "text": "Who confirms a held invoice, and what un-holds it?", "lang": "en", "event_id": "a_f8d0bd5e"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096835247.5671, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096835247.5671, "mode": "listening"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096839133.25, "type": "vad", "t": 1791096839133.238, "speaking": true, "score": 0.9}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096845134.561, "type": "vad", "t": 1791096845134.555, "speaking": false, "score": 0.1}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096845134.7, "type": "utterance", "t_start": 1791096839133.238, "t_end": 1791096845134.555, "role": "user", "text": "Any supplier: if the amount matches an invoice we already paid, put it on hold and ask the supplier. I release it myself once they confirm it's not a duplicate.", "lang": "en", "event_id": "u_b9841761"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096847830.786, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096847830.7842, "mode": "speaking"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096853511.965, "type": "utterance", "t_start": 1791096847830.835, "t_end": 1791096853511.9412, "role": "agent", "text": "Got it. You sent that invoice for a second approval — why does it need two?", "lang": "en", "event_id": "a_d686bca5"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096853512.054, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096853512.053, "mode": "listening"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096857374.6921, "type": "vad", "t": 1791096857374.688, "speaking": true, "score": 0.9}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096861575.7817, "type": "vad", "t": 1791096861575.7717, "speaking": false, "score": 0.1}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096861576.27, "type": "utterance", "t_start": 1791096857374.688, "t_end": 1791096861575.7717, "role": "user", "text": "Every invoice of the UK company goes to Frank, the controller, for second approval.", "lang": "en", "event_id": "u_193a4233"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096864345.038, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096864345.0352, "mode": "speaking"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096869036.355, "type": "utterance", "t_start": 1791096864345.106, "t_end": 1791096869036.295, "role": "agent", "text": "Got it. When is Production the right cost center versus the default one?", "lang": "en", "event_id": "a_723e86e0"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096869036.6367, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096869036.633, "mode": "listening"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096872910.877, "type": "vad", "t": 1791096872910.8733, "speaking": true, "score": 0.9}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096877111.709, "type": "vad", "t": 1791096877111.705, "speaking": false, "score": 0.1}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096877111.807, "type": "utterance", "t_start": 1791096872910.8733, "t_end": 1791096877111.705, "role": "user", "text": "Equipment over 5,000 net is capex: Plants and Machineries and the Production cost center.", "lang": "en", "event_id": "u_4e240188"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096879473.982, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096879473.98, "mode": "speaking"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096883505.108, "type": "utterance", "t_start": 1791096879474.025, "t_end": 1791096883505.085, "role": "agent", "text": "Got it. Why did you choose that vendor for this invoice?", "lang": "en", "event_id": "a_e2190646"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096883505.186, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096883505.185, "mode": "listening"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096887544.4382, "type": "vad", "t": 1791096887544.4329, "speaking": true, "score": 0.9}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096889345.616, "type": "vad", "t": 1791096889345.6099, "speaking": false, "score": 0.1}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096889345.7083, "type": "utterance", "t_start": 1791096887544.4329, "t_end": 1791096889345.6099, "role": "user", "text": "Yes, that's how I do it.", "lang": "en", "event_id": "u_ec55d267"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096891046.976, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096891046.9749, "mode": "speaking"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096901018.1948, "type": "utterance", "t_start": 1791096891047.024, "t_end": 1791096901018.163, "role": "agent", "text": "Got it. You moved it from small tools to Plants and Machineries. Does that 5,000 capex rule apply to other equipment categories too, or only compressors and the like?", "lang": "en", "event_id": "a_20081cd2"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096901018.2952, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096901018.293, "mode": "listening"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096904897.595, "type": "vad", "t": 1791096904897.591, "speaking": true, "score": 0.9}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096909098.797, "type": "vad", "t": 1791096909098.7917, "speaking": false, "score": 0.1}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096909098.897, "type": "utterance", "t_start": 1791096904897.591, "t_end": 1791096909098.7917, "role": "user", "text": "Equipment over 5,000 net is capex: Plants and Machineries and the Production cost center.", "lang": "en", "event_id": "u_831851aa"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096913621.575, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096913621.5732, "mode": "speaking"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096918312.738, "type": "utterance", "t_start": 1791096913621.627, "t_end": 1791096918312.717, "role": "agent", "text": "Got it. Let me walk you through how I handle these purchase invoices.", "lang": "en", "event_id": "a_e05e01d7"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096918312.84, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096918312.8389, "mode": "listening"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096918312.8928, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096918312.8928, "mode": "speaking"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096922343.096, "type": "utterance", "t_start": 1791096918312.9111, "t_end": 1791096922343.07, "role": "agent", "text": "First I open the supplier invoice and review what it's for.", "lang": "en", "event_id": "a_6f4c60bb"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096922343.2031, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096922343.2021, "mode": "listening"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096922343.247, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096922343.247, "mode": "speaking"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096933304.435, "type": "utterance", "t_start": 1791096922343.272, "t_end": 1791096933304.408, "role": "agent", "text": "If it's equipment over 5,000, I change the Expense Head from the default small-tools account to the capital equipment account — Erika's rule is that capex never gets booked to small tools.", "lang": "en", "event_id": "a_4ba3925d"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096933304.545, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096933304.544, "mode": "listening"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096933304.59, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096933304.589, "mode": "speaking"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096938655.727, "type": "utterance", "t_start": 1791096933304.607, "t_end": 1791096938655.7021, "role": "agent", "text": "I also switch the Cost Center from Administration to Production to match the capex treatment.", "lang": "en", "event_id": "a_553fbaa0"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096938655.816, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096938655.815, "mode": "listening"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096938655.869, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096938655.867, "mode": "speaking"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096941036.995, "type": "utterance", "t_start": 1791096938655.9092, "t_end": 1791096941036.969, "role": "agent", "text": "Then I save the corrected invoice.", "lang": "en", "event_id": "a_203eca95"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096941037.087, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096941037.086, "mode": "listening"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096941037.144, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096941037.142, "mode": "speaking"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096945398.31, "type": "utterance", "t_start": 1791096941037.185, "t_end": 1791096945398.284, "role": "agent", "text": "Back on the Purchase Invoice list, I scan for the next item.", "lang": "en", "event_id": "a_81c42fb9"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096945398.405, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096945398.403, "mode": "listening"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096945398.463, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096945398.461, "mode": "speaking"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096954709.6628, "type": "utterance", "t_start": 1791096945398.507, "t_end": 1791096954709.6372, "role": "agent", "text": "If an invoice looks suspicious, I compare it against earlier invoices from the same supplier — Erika notes this supplier double-bills every December with the same amount.", "lang": "en", "event_id": "a_a2e66667"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096954709.763, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096954709.7622, "mode": "listening"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096954709.8171, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096954709.815, "mode": "speaking"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096962700.9949, "type": "utterance", "t_start": 1791096954709.858, "t_end": 1791096962700.969, "role": "agent", "text": "Suspected duplicates go On Hold instead of being booked, pending supplier confirmation, with the approver releasing the hold. Did I get that right?", "lang": "en", "event_id": "a_5c513b5d"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096962701.085, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096962701.084, "mode": "listening"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096966792.5889, "type": "vad", "t": 1791096966792.585, "speaking": true, "score": 0.9}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096971893.801, "type": "vad", "t": 1791096971893.79, "speaking": false, "score": 0.1}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096971893.919, "type": "utterance", "t_start": 1791096966792.585, "t_end": 1791096971893.79, "role": "user", "text": "One detail: maintenance and repairs stay an expense even above 5,000 — only new equipment is capex.", "lang": "en", "event_id": "u_626bae95"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096974195.9482, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096974195.946, "mode": "speaking"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096978557.101, "type": "utterance", "t_start": 1791096974195.992, "t_end": 1791096978557.075, "role": "agent", "text": "I couldn't tell which step to change. Which step do you mean?", "lang": "en", "event_id": "a_e4f09ab8"}
{"dir": "c2s", "at": 1791096978557.187, "type": "agent_state", "t": 1791096978557.186, "mode": "listening"}
