{"dir": "s2c", "type": "say", "id": "teachback-21-2", "text": "If it's equipment over 5,000, I change the Expense Head from the default small-tools account to the capital equipment account — Erika's rule is that capex never gets booked to small tools.", "kind": "teachback", "lang": "en", "step_id": "s2", "_at": 1791096913621.86}
{"dir": "s2c", "type": "say", "id": "teachback-21-3", "text": "I also switch the Cost Center from Administration to Production to match the capex treatment.", "kind": "teachback", "lang": "en", "step_id": "s3", "_at": 1791096913623.2231}
{"dir": "s2c", "type": "say", "id": "teachback-21-4", "text": "Then I save the corrected invoice.", "kind": "teachback", "lang": "en", "step_id": "s4", "_at": 1791096913623.3862}
